# Something Fishy (windurst 52): the trade reads no status. Available with TokakaSpokenTo 1 (GM): a sardine: 210 (70,
# 4360); its finish (available): fame 10 without a completion, the sardine taken, 70 gil, TokakaSpokenTo 0, needToZone.
# The offer does not read needToZone: 208 again, option 1: begun, TokakaSpokenTo 1. Accepted with needToZone (the
# generic zoning flag, which any script may set: here still the one 210 set): 211 (the trigger's accepted side of
# `>= QUEST_ACCEPTED` with needToZone); a sardine (var 1, needToZone): nothing.
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-188.3,-2.0,66.3 job=WAR lvl=75
item BastoreSardine1 x2
charvar TokakaSpokenTo 1
login
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x1         # available, var 1: 210 (70, 4360)
finish                                  # available: fame 10; no completion; taken; 70 gil; var 0; needToZone
trigger Tokaka                          # default 207
finish
trigger Tokaka                          # available (needToZone not read): 208 (0, 4360)
finish option=1                         # begun; TokakaSpokenTo 1
trigger Tokaka                          # default 207
finish
trigger Tokaka                          # accepted, needToZone: 211
finish
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x1         # accepted, var 1, needToZone: nothing
